ZaloCRM / Monarch frontend (apps/crm-ui)
========================================

This tree is a copy of the ZaloCRM community frontend (Vue 3 + Vite + Vuetify
+ Monarch UI) for use as a **UI reference / component library** inside the
Ohamar monorepo.

