IMPORTANT — Ohamar channel strategy (direction B)
-------------------------------------------------
- Zalo personal account sessions are owned ONLY by Ohamar (zaloclaw / gateway).
- Do NOT run this app's original Zalo channel stack (CRM zca-js pool) against
  the same nick as Ohamar.
- This package is NOT wired to Ohamar APIs by default. Most screens expect the
  ZaloCRM backend. Port views incrementally to Ohamar/ops-console APIs.

If you modify this UI and offer it as a network service, AGPL §13 requires
providing Corresponding Source to users.
